###  http://purl.org/ontoksd#step
ontoksd:step rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
             rdfs:domain ontoksd:Scale ;
             rdfs:range xsd:decimal .


###  http://purl.org/ontoksd#upperBound
ontoksd:upperBound rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
                   rdfs:subPropertyOf owl:topDataProperty ;
                   rdfs:domain ontoksd:ScaleInterval ;
                   rdfs:range xsd:decimal ;
                   rdfs:comment """Definition

Specifies the upper numeric bound of a scale interval.

Comment

The property upperBound identifies the maximum boundary value of a ScaleInterval. Together with lowerBound, it defines the numeric range covered by the interval.

For example, in the interval (3.0, 6.0], the upper bound is 6.0.""" .


